# Intentional architecture decisions for this project

# Internet-facing ALB is intentional because Launch2Live is a public web application.
AWS-0053

# HTTP listener is retained until a real domain and ACM certificate are configured.
# HTTPS listener is already supported conditionally by the Terraform configuration.
AWS-0054

# Outbound internet access is required for normal ALB/EC2 operation,
# package updates and application dependencies.
AWS-0104
